  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2020/09/IMG_20200916_192047.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>La vesrpada d&#39;aquest dimecres. Primer, la tradicional visita per a ofrenar al Salvador, enguany redu&iuml;da a causa dels protocols per la Covid-19.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2020/09/IMG_20200916_200545.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>Despr&eacute;s ja al camp de La Serratella, presentaci&oacute; estricta del planter de jugadors</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2020/09/IMG_20200916_205520.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>per a a acabar amb un partit contra el CD Castell&oacute; B, que ha guanyat 0-1.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presencdondatemporada2021/img_20200916_190521.jpg\" alt=\"img_20200916_190521\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presencdondatemporada2021/img_20200916_190542.jpg\" alt=\"img_20200916_190542\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presencdondatemporada2021/img_20200916_190547.jpg\" alt=\"img_20200916_190547\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presencdondatemporada2021/img_20200916_190616.jpg\" alt=\"img_20200916_190616\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presencdondatemporada2021/img_20200916_190648.jpg\" alt=\"img_20200916_190648\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/presencdondatemporada2021/img_20200916_190717.jpg\" alt=\"img_20200916_190717\" style=\"max-width: